### Page 3 of 4

```text
TABLE 1.:
SURROUNDING LAND USES:
EXECUTIVE SUMMARY:
This Final Plat is a replat of the Western Hills
0th Filing Subdivision. The purpose of the replat is
to clarify ownership patterns for this block in relation to the existing City Pumphouse facility
located in the middle of the block. This replat would clarify those ownership patterns and would
simplify the legal descriptions of each. Drainage and utility easements would be clarified through
the replat. Two of the abutting lots owned by the Fowler family (current Lots 12 & 13) would be
combined into the new Lot 3 as the two lots are used as one family parcel with the house on the
southern half and the rear yard and deck on the northern half of the new, combined Lot 3.
After the submittal of the staff report to the Planning Commission, the owner of the abutting Lot
3 informed staff that a utility easement on the City-owned lot had been “dropped off” of the plat
during the 10th Filing replat for this subdivision and this owner asked that the easement be shown
on this replat. Staff conducted a site visit and research of this power company utility easement
and found where it should be identified and labeled on this replat.
Consequently, staff
recommended conditional-approval of the Preliminary and Final Plat to the Planning Commission
with the following condition:
Label the utility easements on Lot 4.
On April 3, 2017, the
Commission recommended conditional-approval of the Final Plat to the Governing Body with that
same condition.
Due to meeting the criteria of Sections 2.1.24 and 2.1.34 the
Planning Commission recommends conditional-approval of the Final Plat with the
following condition:
1.
Label the utility easements on Lot 4.
On April 11, 2017, the Applicant revised the Final Plat to provide this utility easement on Lot 4
and, therefore, this condition has been met. The concerned neighbor has been notified of the
revised plat with the proper utility easement noted. Staff recommends approval of the revised
Final Plat without a condition.
Western Hills 15th Filing Final Plat/UDC-17-00129
